Third-party notices
====================

1MIND can optionally load two routing datasets published by the v2fly project.
They are not shipped in this repository. `npm run geo:fetch` downloads the
pinned release assets into `data/geo/` after checking each official
`.sha256sum` file against `geo.lock.json`. The bytes are not written when a
checksum disagrees.

Loyalsoldier geoip/geosite and sing-box rule sets are GPL-3.0. This project
does not download, vendor, or link those works.

